# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# STRICT POLICY: publish code and results. Publish NO data derived from
# licensed CPHS microdata.
#
# CMIE Consumer Pyramids microdata is licensed. Git history is permanent -- a
# file committed once and deleted later remains in the repository forever.
# This file must exist before the first `git add`, not after.
#
# Everything under output/ is ignored by default. Only the specific results
# whitelisted at the bottom are published, and each is a RESULT (an estimate
# or a figure), not a dataset.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Licensed source data -- never, under any circumstances
CMIE_Income_raw/
**/household_income_*.csv
*.parquet

# Everything the pipeline writes is ignored unless explicitly allowed below.
#
# NOTE the trailing /* rather than /. Git will not descend into an excluded
# DIRECTORY, so "output/" would make the re-includes below unreachable and
# silently publish nothing. Excluding the directory's CONTENTS instead lets
# the whitelist work.
output/*
!output/results/
output/results/*
!output/results/summary.csv
!output/figures/
output/figures/*
!output/figures/*.png

# Deliberately NOT published, though the code regenerates all of them:
#   panel_district_month.parquet  - the panel itself
#   audit_by_month.csv            - per-wave CPHS sample counts
#   donor_screen.csv              - 844 rows of district sample sizes and SEs
#   level_breaks.csv              - 772 rows of income-derived statistics
#   *_series.csv, *_eventstudy.csv, *_weights.csv, *_sources.csv,
#   *_composition.csv, *_donor_distance.csv
#                                 - district-month series and decompositions
#   cpi_state_sector_monthly.csv  - public domain, but fetch_cpi.py rebuilds it
#                                   in ~5 min, so there is nothing to gain by
#                                   shipping a data file at all

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Python
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
.ipynb_checkpoints/
.pytest_cache/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# OS / editor / scratch
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
_to_delete/
scratch/
*.log
*.tmp
